 "father_note": "Nessa, your mother is Sela \u2014 she made a hard choice in a hard year, and that means something; keep her close. Vela gave me food when she had no reason to, and I have not forgotten it, so watch her and learn what quiet generosity looks like before you decide it's weakness. Fear Mako most: he has strength, he has food, and he only started speaking when he had already decided something. Trust no one who has not paid a cost to stand beside you \u2014 words are free, and this village proved that to me the year it put nine bodies between me and one man's food.",
