  {
   "eid": "e001873",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Sela. I have two food and you have none \u2014 take one, but listen to me first: Mako is sitting on seven and hasn't said a word to anyone, and that's not patience, that's a man who's already made a decision.",
   "who": "Nessa",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001874",
   "kind": "give",
   "text": "Ryn gives 1 food to Dell.",
   "who": "Ryn",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001877",
   "kind": "convo",
   "text": "Bram gathers Nessa to talk.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001878",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "You're my blood, Nessa, and that means something real in a place like this \u2014 not words, real. I've got ten food and I'll teach you what I know about when to take and when to wait, but first I need to know you understand what this village will do to someone who looks weak.",
   "who": "Bram",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
   "eid": "e001879",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "I understand it. I've watched Taric hold one food for three years running and nobody trades with him anymore \u2014 they don't fear him, they just don't think of him. But I want to know what you see in Mako, because he's not weak and he's not talking, and that worries me more than anyone who is.",
   "who": "Nessa",
   "year": 5
  },
  {
