   "eid": "e001900",
   "kind": "say",
   "text": "Eron, Mako has seven food and he's said nothing to anyone all year \u2014 that's not a man being careful, that's a man who's already counted the board and likes what he sees. Watch yourself around him, and don't let him catch you alone.",
